	(text_box "RTL8723DS\n\nConnections:\n- SDIO (1.1/2.0 100MHz DDR50): SD2\n- UART (BT)                  : UART3\n- PCM                        : ESAI2\n\nGPIO:\n- WL_DIS\n- BT_DIS\n- HOST_WAKE_BT\n\nWONT USE:\n- WL_WAKE_HOST\n- BT_WAKE_HOST (pull low for normal?)\n- SUSCLK_IN (32.768k in, else NC)\n\n\nPCM:\n- Supports master/slave, long/short frame sync\n- 8-bit alaw/ulaw, 13bit/16bit PCM linear\n- PCM clk: 64 128 256 512 (kHz)\n\nUART:\n- If we wont use CTS/RTS, RTS is NC and CTS(module) is GND\n\nAdd UART, PCM and GPIO\nRoute last\n\nSABRE SDIO is SD2\n\nPOWER\n3.3V 150mA\n\nMAX POWER\n\nn mode TX: 137mA\nn mode RX: 53mA\nBT TX: 102mA\nBT RX: 76mA"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
